        "original_id": "4a684a8e-ab56-5982-8399-b7611d1a081a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Clarence Brown, Peter Glenville, Sidney Franklin\n- Works: The Yearling\n- Companies: Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\n- Topics: Film directing, acting, family film drama\n\nFacts:\n- Clarence Brown was born on May 10, 1890, and he was an American film director.\n- Peter Glenville was born as Peter Patrick Brabazon Browne on 28 October 1913, and he was an English film and stage actor and director.\n- The film The Yearling was released in 1946 as a Technicolor family film drama.\n- Clarence Brown directed The Yearling.\n- Sidney Franklin produced The Yearling.\n- Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer released The Yearling.\n- The Yearling is about a young boy who adopts a trouble-making young deer.\n- Peter Glenville died on 3 June 1996.\n- Clarence Brown died on August 17, 1987.",
